record(C,'C295: Spanish prime → Tata consortium → Indian public buyer','The24September2021 MoD–Airbus contract covers56 aircraft:16 flyaway and40 Indian-built by a TASL-led consortium also naming TCS. PIB later states INR21,935crore total project cost, without allocating Tata receipts. Airbus records16 cumulative deliveries at30June2026. The2024 assembly-line inauguration is a production milestone, not delivery of all40.',cs,['IN','ES'],['india','spain','mod','airbus','tata-consortium','tasl','tcs','iaf','c295-project'],ce,'2021-09-24 to2026-06-30','2021-09-24','2026-06-30','contract-signed-deliveries-partial','MoD describes domestic manufacturing and offset objectives; manufacturer reports delivery milestones. No irregularity allegation is asserted. Latest retained delivery ledger is30June2026, not a full October2026 completion certificate.',['Same contract as existing force corpus c002/c055/c060; curated path adds exact consortium and updated deliveries, not a second procurement total.','No Airbus→Tata payment amount, TASL/TCS ownership split, offset discharge or supplier profit is established.','No first India-built handover is inferred from the September2026 target or test flight.'])
