record(BCASE,'BrahMos: Indo-Russian JV → Philippine export award → deliveries','BrahMos identifies DRDO and Russia’s NPOM as its JV partners. A31December2021 award accepting USD374,962,800 preceded the28January2022 contract, reported by PNA as PHP18.9billion for three batteries with training and logistics. First delivery is reported inApril2024; DND said another batch was en route23April2025. No complete acceptance or supplier cash receipt is established.',bs,['IN','RU','PH'],['india','russia','philippines','drdo','npom','brahmos','dnd'],be,'2021-12-31 to2025-04-23;1998 formation is historical context','2021-12-31','2025-04-23','export-signed-deliveries-partial','DND described the contract as government-to-government cooperation enabled by a March2021 implementing agreement. Its Secretary confirmed the next batch en route inApril2025. No irregularity finding or criminal allegation is asserted.',['AwardUSD and contractPHP figures describe same acquisition; no cross-currency total or implied exact FX rate.','1998authorisedcapital ratios50.5/49.5 are inception history; no current shareholder ledger, paid-in capital or split of export proceeds verified.','This is the Philippine export, distinct from retained Indian domestic BrahMos contracts.','No all-three-battery completion, new2025/2026 order or advance remittance is established.'],tier='reported')
record(BR,'BrahMos export: signed value and delivery are distinct','The government news agency confirms signature and reports first delivery; the next shipment was still described as en route. Public partner names connect India and Russia to the supplier, without allocating export receipts between them.',bs,['IN','RU','PH'],['brahmos','dnd','drdo','npom'],be,'Contract2022; delivery statement2025',None,'2025-04-23','response-and-gap','DND said the forthcoming shipment was part of the previous order. Corporate JV history describes indefinite IGA extension in2014.',['Indexed PNA article evidence is distinguished from failed direct captures. No deployment locations or private bank account details are mapped.'],tier='reported',kind='response')
record(M,'MQ-9B: US possible-sale estimate → signed Indian acquisition','The US notified Congress on1February2024 of a possible31-aircraft sale estimated at USD3.99billion; its original notice was published in the Federal Register inJanuary2025. India signed a government-to-government acquisition15October2024 and a separate logistics contract with General Atomics Global India Private Limited. GAASI is named as US principal contractor at notification stage. The notification estimate is not the final signed price or a payment.',ms,['IN','US'],['india','usa','mod','us-government','dsca','gaasi','gagi','mq9-project'],me,'2024-02-01 to2025-01-06 publication; delivery forecast outside current window','2024-02-01','2025-01-06','contract-signed-price-and-settlement-gap','MoD confirms both October2024 contracts. Officials quoted by The Hindu forecast deliveries51–72months after signing and initial payment, expected2029–2030; this does not confirm initial payment. No irregularity allegation is asserted.',['No final signed price or actual expenditure is inferred from USD3.99billion notification estimate or approximate press reports.','National funds is the notice funding source; no US loan or grant is asserted.','No ownership link between GAASI and the separately named India logistics counterparty is inferred from brand similarity.','Earlier leased aircraft are separate from the31-aircraft purchase; no deliveries under the new purchase or operational basing are claimed.'])
record(MR,'MQ-9B value, identity and delivery boundary','US notification, Indian acquisition contract and Indian logistics contract are three distinct instruments/stages. Federal publication reproduces the earlier notification, not a new2025 deal. Original ministry confirmation supplies no price or payment. Conditional2029–2030 delivery reporting supplies no actual delivery.',ms,['IN','US'],['mod','us-government','dsca','gaasi','gagi','mq9-project'],me,'Notification2024; publication2025; future delivery forecast',None,'2025-01-06','response-and-gap','Official Indian year-end review confirms signature. The Hindu attributes a future delivery schedule to unnamed officials; this remains reported and conditional.',['No complete contract schedule or supplier cash ledger is retained. Absence in this curated corpus is not proof no payment occurred.'],kind='response')

# Make prose readable without altering IDs, URLs or exact numeric values.
import re
def space(text):
    text=re.sub(r'\b(INR|USD|PHP)(?=\d)',r'\1 ',text)
    text=re.sub(r'(?<=[a-z])(?=(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December))',' ',text)
    text=re.sub(r'(?<=[a-z])(?=\d)',' ',text)
    text=re.sub(r'(?<=[A-Za-z])(?=\d{2,4}\b)|(?<=\d)(?=[A-Za-z])',' ',text)
    text=re.sub(r'(?<=[A-Za-z])(?=\d{2,4}(?:\s|[,.;]))',' ',text)
    text=re.sub(r':(?=\d)',': ',text)
    text=text.replace('C 295','C295').replace('C-295 MW','C-295MW').replace('MQ-9 B','MQ-9B').replace('ISO 3166','ISO3166')
    return text
for group in ['sources','entities','relationships','records']:
    for row in out[group]:
        if row.get('id')=='c295-spain-india':row['title']='C295: Indian public buyer → Spanish prime → Tata consortium'
        for key in ['title','label','summary','locator','identityBasis','dateBasis','period','response','falsifier']:
            if isinstance(row.get(key),str):row[key]=space(row[key])
        for key in ['limitations','alternativeExplanations']:
            if key in row:row[key]=[space(x) for x in row[key]]
        for a in row.get('amounts',[]):a['period']=space(a['period']);a['stage']=space(a['stage'])
(B.parent/'defence-trade.json').write_text(json.dumps(out,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\n')
